IMPORT prelude

-- Civil Law (Wrongs) Act 2002 (ACT), chapter 8A (institutional child abuse) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- Only the built-in date functions (DATE_FROM_DMY, DATE_SERIAL, DATE_FROM_SERIAL); no daydate, no YMD. Dates are
-- compared by serial. "Within 28 days of the application being made" is read with the day of the application excluded,
-- so the last day is the 28th day after it; a last day on a weekend or public holiday is not moved (fork F3 in NOTES.md:
-- the Legislation Act 2001 (ACT), which says how periods are counted, is not deposited).
--
-- (c) Australian Capital Territory. Used under CC BY 4.0 (SOURCE-LICENSE.md). Unofficial text.
-- BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `Dates for chapter 8A`

GIVEN d IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`the date` d m y MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY d m y

-- The day a number of plain days after a day.
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, `the start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the day that is` n `days after` `the start` MEANS DATE_FROM_SERIAL (DATE_SERIAL `the start` PLUS n)

GIVEN a IS A DATE, b IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE a `falls before` b IF DATE_SERIAL a LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL b

GIVEN a IS A DATE, b IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE a `falls after` b IF DATE_SERIAL a GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL b

-- Commencement dates, from the endnotes of the deposited republications.
-- Limitation Act 1985 s 21C: inserted by the Justice and Community Safety Legislation Amendment Act 2016 (No 2)
-- (A2016-53) s 8, whose part 3 commenced 26 August 2016 (Limitation Act 1985 R28, endnote 3).
`the day Limitation Act s 21C commenced` MEANS `the date` 26 8 2016

-- Part 8A.3: inserted by the Justice and Community Safety Legislation Amendment Act 2022 (A2022-21) s 9, whose part 3
-- commenced 10 December 2022 (endnote 3).
`the day part 8A.3 commenced` MEANS `the date` 10 12 2022

-- Part 8A.1A: its heading and ss 114BB, 114BC, 114BE inserted by the Civil Law (Wrongs) (Organisational Child Abuse
-- Liability) Amendment Act 2025 (A2025-32) s 4, whose remainder commenced 13 November 2025 (endnote 3).
`the day part 8A.1A commenced` MEANS `the date` 13 11 2025

-- Division 8A.1A.2 (ss 114BBB-114BBD, the duty to prevent child abuse): inserted by the Civil Law (Wrongs) Amendment
-- Act 2026 (A2026-7) s 10, whose remainder commenced 16 May 2026 (endnotes 3 and 4). Finding 1 in NOTES.md.
`the day division 8A.1A.2 commenced` MEANS `the date` 16 5 2026
